- Team ID
    GetGut@AAU

- Task ID
    6.1.2

- Run ID
    1

- Type of training applied
    Named Entity Recognition and Disambiguation (NERD) using SapBERT-based contextual dictionary matching. Contextual entity-URI dictionary created from training data, with hybrid similarity scoring combining span-level and context-aware representations as described in the scripts of this repository

- Pre-processing methods
    Sentence-level context extraction using NLTK punkt tokenizer (see Scripts/EL_dictionary_creation.py). Context format: [entity_span] [SEP] [host_sentence]. Lowercase normalisation for entity spans.

- Training data used
    Gold, silver, silver2025 training annotations

- Relevant details of the run
    - Base Model: SapBERT (cambridgeltl/SapBERT-from-PubMedBERT-fulltext)
    - Hybrid Scoring Weights: 0.85 (span similarity) + 0.15 (contextual similarity)

- A link to a GitHub repository enabling easy reproducibility of the run:
https://github.com/SophusJ/GetGut-AAU
